      "message": "fix(deburr): a face pick keeps naming the model\n\nThe quick gate showed that `turned_selected_deburr_cuts_like_the_baked_part`\n(#2284) selects the model of a Deburr with a face pick. The first version\nof #1888 refused that pick. Now only an edge chain in the source narrows\nthe ride. A face, patch or vertex pick names the model, as before. The\nMCP pick door is unchanged from main.\n\nRefs #1888\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
